  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>With a soothing gesture, you put up to three willing creatures of your choice that you can see within range to sleep: they have the &amp;Reference[unconscious apply=false]{Unconscious} condition for the duration. The spell ends on a target if it takes damage or if another creature takes an action to shake it awake. A target that stays Unconscious for the whole duration gains the benefits of finishing a Short Rest, and it can’t be affected by this spell again until it finishes a Long Rest.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> You can target one additional willing creature for each spell slot level above 3.</p>",
